<% content_for :title, 'Check your email' %>
<p class="eyebrow">Almost there</p>
<h1>Check your email</h1>
<p class="sub">If <strong><%= @email %></strong> can be used for a new account, we've sent a link to it. Click the link to confirm your address and sign in.</p>
<p class="hint">Nothing arrived after a few minutes? Check your spam folder, or try <a href="<%= login_path %>">signing in</a> to get a new link.</p>
